]]

--[[ Requirements
Rig Type: R6
]]

--[[   Need Help ?
----- How to publish animations ?
At the very top, next to "Home" click the "Avatar" tab, then go to "Animation Editor"
click the three dots, select your desired animation, and then click the three dots 
again and select "Publish on Roblox" to publish it on Roblox.

----- How to change speed,durations etc.
Each script is explained in detail. Just open and read the scripts.

----- How to changer Rig Type to R6
At the very top, next to "Home" click the "Avatar" tab, then go to  "Settings"
and click the three dots and select "R6".
]]

